    "detailed_description": "&quot;1980s90s Style - Retro Track Car Racer&quot; is 3 games in one, &quot;The main game is an America tour with 20 levels&quot;, &quot;DLC 1 is Asian tour with 20 levels&quot; and &quot;DLC 2 is Europe tour with 20 levels&quot;. Now with Dlc 3 &quot;Turbo Dlc with Turbo Tour and Turbo Car&quot;.<br />\r\nIt's a retro 1980s and 90s styled, track racing game, You are alone in the game. It's a single player game. But with the option to save multiple user profiles.<br />\r\nThe ambiance in the game has 34 musics &quot;check the music in the video&quot;, with a simple retro look outdoor architecture style.<br />\r\nYou should play each level many times to get better records.<br />\r\nIt's a total 60 level game to do the checkpoints and the needed laps to the finish line.<br />\r\nEnjoy the retro styled music and Good luck!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Update August 2023 - Added audio sound fx<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Update October 2023 - Added Turbo DLC<br />\r\n- Turbo Tour<br />\r\n- Turbo Car",
